  "senses": [
    {
      "pos": "n.",
      "zh": "下午"
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "All the boys went swimming that "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "afternoon"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " except Bob because he had a cold."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "那天下午除了鲍勃，所有的男孩都去游泳了，因为他感冒了。"
    },
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "A terrible earthquake hit the Pacific Ocean near Northeastern Japan on the "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "afternoon"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " of last Christmas."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "去年圣诞节的下午，在日本东北部太平洋附近海域发生了一次可怕的地震。"
    }
  ],
  "tip": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "afternoon (evening, morning) 是常考单词，主要是考其固定搭配："
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "1) 表示“在下午（晚上、早上）”，要用介词 in，如：in the afternoon (evening, morning)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "2) 表示具体“某天的下午（晚上、早上）”，要用介词 on，如：on Sunday afternoon (evening, morning), on the afternoon (evening, morning) of Jan. 2"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "3) 当 afternoon (evening, morning) 前面有 this, that, last, yesterday, tomorrow 这些词语时，就不能用介词，如：this/that/last/yesterday/tomorrow afternoon (evening, morning)"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
